# SECRETAREA DESKTOP — ULTIMATE PC HEALTH, HARDWARE INTELLIGENCE, DIAGNOSTICS & UPGRADE ADVISOR

## PROJECT OBJECTIVE

I want to transform the existing Hardware Monitor page in SecretArea Desktop into a comprehensive, intelligent PC Hardware Inspection, Health Diagnostics, Maintenance, Gaming Compatibility, and Upgrade Recommendation platform.

This must be a complete hardware intelligence system for BOTH Desktop PCs and Laptops.

The application should automatically discover, identify, monitor, analyze, and evaluate as much information as technically possible about the user's computer.

I want users to open SecretArea and understand:

- What hardware their computer contains.
- The exact model, manufacturer, generation, and specifications of every component.
- How many fans their computer has and which ones are working.
- How many physical ports and connectors their computer has and their capabilities.
- Whether their hardware is healthy, overheating, outdated, or potentially failing.
- Whether their computer needs cleaning, thermal paste inspection, maintenance, or replacement parts.
- Whether their PC is suitable for modern games and professional applications.
- Which components are limiting performance.
- Which components should be upgraded.
- Whether their laptop or desktop will remain suitable for their needs in the coming years, including 2030 and beyond.

IMPORTANT: This must be based on real hardware detection and reliable information. Never fabricate specifications, sensor readings, health percentages, or benchmark results.

Before implementing anything, inspect the existing Hardware Monitor architecture and reuse existing functionality wherever possible.

