## 33. REAL DATA VS ESTIMATED DATA

Every hardware information item must have an appropriate data status.

Use:

- Detected.
- Measured.
- Manufacturer Specification.
- Estimated.
- Not Supported.
- Not Detected.
- Sensor Unavailable.
- Unknown.

For every important value, identify its source where possible.

